From b48970c8ed321a022d8a77228b4034679df44885 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Daniel Primosch <dprimosc@ucsd.edu>
Date: Fri, 23 Oct 2026 12:45:29 -0700
Subject: [PATCH] Add efficiency-at-fixed-purity validation metric and optional
 best-efficiency checkpoint

New option checkpoint_eff_at_purity (purity target, 0 = off). When set, the
validation epoch logs validation_eff_at_purity (overall, per topology and
balanced) plus validation_purity / validation_efficiency at the detection
cut, and train.py adds a ModelCheckpoint on validation_eff_at_purity next to
the existing top-3 on validation_average_jet_accuracy.
